{{also|Kaffir}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[caffre]], [[kaffer]], [[kafir]], [[kaphar]], [[kaphir]], [[kafari]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|كَفَّار||infidel}} or {{m|ar|كَافِر||unbeliever}}, both from {{m|ar|كَفَرَ||to cover, to hide}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|South Africa|pejorative|offensive|ethnic slur}} A [[black]] person.
{{seeCites}}

